2. In these Regulations, unless the context otherwise requires —
“Act” means the Criminal Justice Reform Act 2018 (Act 19 of 2018);
“Code” means the Criminal Procedure Code (Cap. 68) as amended by the Act;
“unamended Code” means the Code as in force on 30 October 2018.

11. Section 108 of the Act does not apply to either of the following:
(a)an application, to review an earlier decision of an appellate court, that was made to the High Court or the Court of Appeal before 31 October 2018, and is pending on 30 October 2018;
(b)a review, of an earlier decision of an appellate court pursuant to an application mentioned in paragraph (a), that is pending on 30 October 2018.
